   "caption": {
    "en": "Bijoya Dashami 2026 in Kolkata: the last day of Durga Puja, rite by rite 🙏\n\nDashami is Wednesday 21 October. The priest immerses the goddess's reflection in a mirror, darpan bisarjan, and from that moment she has left the idol.\n\nMarried women perform boron, wiping her face with a betel leaf as if drying a daughter's tears, then play sindoor khela with each other. The idols go to the Hooghly in procession, and Kolkata's immersions run over Dashami and the days after on a schedule set by the authorities.\n\nAt the ghats, follow police instructions and keep small children away from the riverbank at peak times.\n\nWho gets your first Shubho Bijoya call? Tell us in the comments 👇",
